A line past a body's column is read in the body, and a quote does not rebase

```
:: t
: d
  - para
    [r]: /u
x

[r][]
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>
    <p>d</p>
    <ul>
      <li>para
x</li>
    </ul>
  </dd>
</dl>
<p><a href="/u">r</a></p>
```

```
:: t
: d
  1. para
     [r]: /u
x

[r][]
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>
    <p>d</p>
    <ol>
      <li>para
x</li>
    </ol>
  </dd>
</dl>
<p><a href="/u">r</a></p>
```

```
[^n]: d
  - para
    [r]: /u
x

[r][] [^n]
.
<p><a href="/u">r</a> <a id="fnref1" href="#fn1" role="doc-noteref"><sup>1</sup></a></p>
<section role="doc-endnotes" aria-label="Footnotes">
  <hr>
  <ol>
    <li id="fn1">
      <p>d</p>
      <ul>
        <li>para
x</li>
      </ul>
      <p><a href="#fnref1" role="doc-backlink" aria-label="Back to reference">↩</a></p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>
```

```
:: t
: d
  - para
    [r]: /u
  more

[r][]
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>
    <p>d</p>
    <ul>
      <li>para
more</li>
    </ul>
  </dd>
</dl>
<p><a href="/u">r</a></p>
```

```
:: t
: d
  - para
    # H
x
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>
    <p>d</p>
    <ul>
      <li>para
        <h1 id="H">H</h1>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </dd>
</dl>
<p>x</p>
```

```
:: t
: d
  - para
    {#k}
x
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>
    <p>d</p>
    <ul>
      <li>para</li>
    </ul>
  </dd>
</dl>
<p>x</p>
```

```
:: t
: d
  - para
    *[A]: b
x
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>
    <p>d</p>
    <ul>
      <li>para
x</li>
    </ul>
  </dd>
</dl>
```

```
- > para
  >  [r]: /u
tail

[r][]
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <blockquote><p>para
tail</p></blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
<p><a href="/u">r</a></p>
```

```
- > para
  >  [^f]: n
tail
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <blockquote><p>para</p></blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- > para
  >  {#x}
tail
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <blockquote><p>para</p></blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>tail</p>
```

