> - > para
>   >  [r]: /u
tail

[r][]
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <blockquote><p>para
tail</p></blockquote>
    </li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
<p><a href="/u">r</a></p>
```

